                at Umeå University. We were a total of four people in the project group, and we 
                decided after discussion back and forward to collaborate with "Euro Padel Leauge". 
                Euro Padel League is a padel event combining competitive
                tournaments with social activities. Our project focused on designing
                and developing a mobile application that brings match information,
                events, teams, players and tournament results together in one
                accessible application.
            </p>


