        <section class="project-section">

            <div class="section-number">01</div>

            <div class="section-content">
                <h2>CHALLENGE</h2>

                <p>
                    Euro Padel League did not have a dedicated mobile application for
                    players and spectators to access up-to-date tournament information.
                
                    The challenge was to transform a broad set of requirements into a
                    clear and accessible mobile experience, making it easy to navigate
                    between matches, teams, players, standings and events without
                    overwhelming the user.
                </p>
            </div>

        </section>

        <section class="project-section">

            <div class="section-number">02</div>

            <div class="section-content">

                <h2>WORKING WITH THE CLIENT</h2>

                <p>
                    The project was developed in collaboration with Euro Padel League.
                    We worked iteratively with the client throughout the design process,
                    using feedback to refine the information architecture, content and
                    visual direction.
                
                    <br>
                    <br>
                
                    Early discussions focused on defining the scope and understanding
                    what information was most important to users. This included
                    tournament structures, seasonal events, team and player information,
                    standings and previous results.
                
                    <br>
                    <br>
                
                    One important insight was that the platform should communicate the
                    experience around the tournaments, not only the matches themselves.
                    The client wanted the events, locations and surrounding activities
                    to be more visible.
                </p>

              

            </div>

        </section>

